Subject: [PATCH 03/10] Add vanilla mode: run as plain OrcaSlicer when Bambu
 Studio is absent

is_bambu_host_mode() keys off the host exe name (bambu-studio.exe = Bambu mode,
orca-slicer.exe = vanilla). In vanilla mode the network plugin and signing hooks
are not loaded (on_init_network gate), so non-Bambu users get plain OrcaSlicer.

- Launcher: if no bambu-studio.exe host, load the studio dll in-process (OrcaSlicer.dll
  then BambuStudio.dll) instead of erroring; ensure BambuStudio.dll exists before forking.
- Installer: when Bambu Studio is absent, rename BambuStudio.dll -> OrcaSlicer.dll and
  skip the host copy.
---
 CMakeLists.txt              | 10 +++++++---
 src/OrcaSlicer_app_msvc.cpp | 27 ++++++++++++++++++++-------
 src/libslic3r/Utils.hpp     |  3 +++
 src/libslic3r/utils.cpp     | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/slic3r/GUI/GUI_App.cpp  |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 11611ee3f52..c696f1c0067 100644
